Banking System

Encapsulation

A bank account keeps its balance private. Customers cannot directly modify it; they use deposit and withdrawal methods.

class BankAccount {
    private double balance = 1000;

    public void deposit(double amount) {
        if (amount > 0) {
            balance += amount;
        }
    }

    public double getBalance() {
        return balance;
    }
}

Abstraction

A customer calls deposit() without needing to understand all the internal banking operations.

Both concepts can work together in the same application.
